Third-party components:

- libxev (https://github.com/mitchellh/libxev) — MIT License,
  Copyright (c) Mitchell Hashimoto. Used as the event loop / networking
  backend.

- nats.c (https://github.com/nats-io/nats.c) — Apache License 2.0,
  Copyright (c) The NATS Authors. Vendored under `vendor/nats.c/` and
  statically linked into the outbound NATS bridge (when built with the
  default `-Dbridge=true`). Full license text at `vendor/nats.c/LICENSE`.

- OpenSSL (https://www.openssl.org/) — Apache License 2.0,
  Copyright (c) The OpenSSL Project Authors. Dynamically linked at
  runtime when the bridge is enabled; not redistributed by this project.
